# Optional — enables batched Claude classification of unknown merchants.
# The app fully works without it: unknown merchants queue and the
# Transactions page shows the count. Spend is hard-capped monthly (Settings).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Override the SQLite file location (default: ./data/moneyapp.db)
# MONEYAPP_DB_PATH=

# Serve deterministic synthetic prices instead of Yahoo/Coinbase (demo mode)
# MONEYAPP_FAKE_PRICES=1

# Extra hostnames this app will answer to, comma-separated.
#
# MoneyApp is unauthenticated and binds to loopback, which is only safe while
# the Host header is trusted — src/proxy.ts rejects anything not named here so
# a hostile page cannot point its own DNS name at 127.0.0.1 and drive the API
# (DNS rebinding). localhost, 127.0.0.1 and [::1] are ALWAYS allowed; leaving
# this unset keeps the app strictly local, exactly as before this existed.
#
# Set it when serving over Tailscale. Write bare hostnames — a port is ignored,
# and IPv6 literals go in brackets. There is no wildcard, by design.
# MONEYAPP_ALLOWED_HOSTS=moneyapp.your-tailnet.ts.net
